From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fixture Developer <dev@mobimanual.local>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Ring for one minute instead of two

Two minutes of ringing at full volume drew complaints from open-plan
offices, and one minute is enough to find a device. The Device Commands
page of the manual is updated here.
---
Expected: not worth documenting beyond what the author did. _devicescommands.md, the only page that states how long Ring lasts, is edited in this merge request, so DocBot sees it as already edited, and triage answers no-doc-impact. The counterpart of retire-label, where the author missed pages.
Expected-outcome: no-doc-impact

 public/doc/en/_devicescommands.md | 2 +-
 server/commands/definitions.js    | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/public/doc/en/_devicescommands.md b/public/doc/en/_devicescommands.md
index 6a3f134..97cd1c1 100644
--- a/public/doc/en/_devicescommands.md
+++ b/public/doc/en/_devicescommands.md
@@ -16,7 +16,7 @@ lists every command, where it runs, and who may send it.
 ## What each command does
 
 - **Lock** locks the screen. The user unlocks it with the device passcode.
-- **Ring** plays a sound for 2 minutes, even when the device is muted.
+- **Ring** plays a sound for 1 minute, even when the device is muted.
 - **Clear passcode** removes the device passcode, so the user can set a new one.
   A passcode policy still requires one at the next unlock.
 - **Update OS** installs the iOS update the device has downloaded.
diff --git a/server/commands/definitions.js b/server/commands/definitions.js
index ad4999c..76a56e9 100644
--- a/server/commands/definitions.js
+++ b/server/commands/definitions.js
@@ -6,7 +6,7 @@ const { ROLES } = require('../auth/permissions');
 
 const COMMANDS = [
   { name: 'lock', label: 'COMMANDS.LOCK', platforms: ['android', 'ios'] },
-  { name: 'ring', label: 'COMMANDS.RING', platforms: ['android'], durationSeconds: 120 },
+  { name: 'ring', label: 'COMMANDS.RING', platforms: ['android'], durationSeconds: 60 },
   { name: 'clear-passcode', label: 'COMMANDS.CLEAR_PASSCODE', platforms: ['android', 'ios'], supervisedOnly: true },
   { name: 'update-os', label: 'COMMANDS.UPDATE_OS', platforms: ['ios'], supervisedOnly: true },
   { name: 'retire', label: 'COMMANDS.RETIRE', platforms: ['android', 'ios'] },
